    "Def (Ang (An A B C))"
    "Def (Ang (An A1 B1 C1))"
    "Cong (Geos (Ang (An A B C)) add Emp) (Geos (Ang (An A1 B1 C1)) add Emp)"
    "Bet_Point (Se A D) B"
